# ============================================================================
# .gitignore — Agent 365 × Agent Framework samples
# Goal: never commit secrets or machine-generated local configuration.
# Templates (*.env.template, *.env.example, *.template.json) ARE tracked.
# ============================================================================

# --- Secrets & local runtime config (NEVER COMMIT) --------------------------
# Real environment files with keys/secrets/tokens
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.env.user
**/*.user
# Microsoft 365 Agents Toolkit local env (may hold keys/bearer tokens)
**/env/.env.playground
**/env/.env.playground.user
# Agent 365 CLI machine-generated config (contains blueprint client secret + IDs)
**/a365.generated.config*.json
# Tenant-specific input config — copy each *.example, then fill in your own values.
# ACA blueprint config (tenantId + client app id + names)
**/a365.config.json
# Web SPA runtime config (SPA app id, tenant authority, agent endpoints/scopes)
ui/config.js
# Custom MCP filled registration payloads (environment-specific FQDN); *.template.json stays tracked.
custom-mcp/register-anon.json
custom-mcp/register-auth.json
# Provisioning wizard: tenant-specific plan + generated scaffolding output.
# The canonical plan is now PER-LAB at generated/<prefix>/a365-deployment-plan.json (covered by
# generated/). The repo-root path is retired but kept ignored as a safety net for any legacy stray copy.
a365-deployment-plan.json
generated/
# Local scratch/analysis output (e.g. extracted system-instruction dumps)
tmp/
# Backups / historical copies of config that may hold secrets
**/*.OLD.json
**/*bak*.json
**/*before*.json
# One-off id/secret dumps
**/preauth.txt
**/spa_appid.txt
# MCS MCP client-app secret dumps (New-McsMcpClientApp.ps1)
**/*.secret.txt
# MSAL token caches (contain refresh tokens) — Prompts Sender and any local harness
**/token_cache.json
# Local throwaway test harness (never commit; may hold tokens)
_test/
# Certificates / keys
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key

# --- Azure Developer CLI (regenerated by `azd provision`) -------------------
**/.azure/

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- Node / SPA -------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/

# --- Build & tooling artifacts ----------------------------------------------
**/devTools/
**/*.log
**/manifest/manifest.zip
**/bin/
**/obj/

# --- Companion DOCX (screenshots expose environment-specific details) -------
docs-companion/

# --- OS / editor noise ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Office lock/owner files (e.g. ~$Agent365-Lab-Overview.pptx created while the deck is open)
~$*

# ============================================================================
# Keep the templates (explicitly un-ignore in case a broad rule catches them)
# ============================================================================
!**/.env.template
!**/.env.example
!**/*.template.json
!**/*.example
